(LIMITATION OF BRUTE-FORCE) Tj
50 483.0 Td
(===========================) Tj
50 470.0 Td
(  - O\(n^2\) becomes impractical for n > 100,000 drones.) Tj
50 457.0 Td
(  - Divide-and-Conquer closest pair runs in O\(n log n\).) Tj
50 444.0 Td
(  - For a real drone monitoring system with many drones, a spatial) Tj
50 431.0 Td
(    index \(k-d tree\) or divide-and-conquer would be recommended.) Tj
50 418.0 Td
(  - Brute force is acceptable for n <= ~10,000 drone fleets.) Tj
